# UG Cars Website

A pre-owned car marketplace website built to showcase available vehicles, filtering, and user-friendly browsing.

## Features
- Car listings
- Vehicle details
- Responsive design
- Search/filter functionality

## Tech Stack
- HTML
- CSS
- JavaScript

## Future Improvements
- Backend integration
- User authentication
- Database support

# UG Cars – Pre-owned Cars Website
Open `index.html` in a browser (no install needed). Internet is used for fonts, icons and the map.

**Admin:** open `admin/index.html` (or the "Admin" link in the footer)
- Username: `admin`  Password: `ugcars@2026` (change in `admin/index.html`)

## Structure
```
index.html            Home: hero, filters + inventory, why us, testimonials, contact
car-details.html      Gallery, specs, features, enquiry, similar cars
sell-car.html / finance.html / exchange.html  Forms saved to admin Enquiries
admin/index.html      Admin login
admin/dashboard.html  Add / edit / delete cars, search, status, stats
admin/enquiries.html  Customer leads with status tracking
assets/css/style.css  Styles (colours from the logo)
assets/js/app.js      Data store, helpers, shared header/footer
assets/js/home.js     Filters, search, sorting
assets/js/details.js  Car details page
assets/js/admin.js    Admin CRUD
assets/images/        Logo, favicon, car photos
```
Data is saved in the browser (localStorage), so cars added in admin show on the website in the same browser. Production use needs a real backend and server-side login.
